{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/4065","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:07.979363+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Obsolete?","created_at":"2021-08-31T16:47:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/4065#issuecomment-909407449","id":909407449,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/4065","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M42NHTZ","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/909407449/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-08-31T16:47:42Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/909407449","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4010439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ScottTodd","id":4010439,"login":"ScottTodd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTA0Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"vmla doesn't exist, so I'd say yes :)","created_at":"2021-08-31T16:49:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/4065#issuecomment-909408448","id":909408448,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/4065","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M42NHjA","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":1,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/909408448/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-08-31T16:49:02Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/909408448","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"There are two similar errors that VMLA raises when executing MLIR generated by the tensorflow integrations. This issue affects both the python test runner and `iree-run-mlir`. MLIR files and instructions for reproducing the errors with `iree-run-mlir` are linked below.\r\n\r\n### `tf.math.mod` (and others) with dynamic shapes\r\n\r\nVMLA [passes for input tensors up to rank 5](https://gist.github.com/phoenix-meadowlark/546e88ca20781f1ed1e23d84a1c0d1e4), but [fails for input tensors of rank 6 or higher](https://gist.github.com/phoenix-meadowlark/90c4c764748616f87c8ab9e0c10904f7).\r\n\r\nThere isn't an example of vulkan passing for this IR because its dynamic shape support isn't there yet.\r\n\r\n```\r\nE iree/hal/host/inproc_command_buffer.cc:244] DeviceQueue failure while executing command; permanently failing all future commands: iree/hal/host/serial/serial_command_processor.cc:119: INVALID_ARGUMENT; Push constants out of range\r\nE iree/tools/iree-run-mlir-main.cc:474] Failure for split at line #1: INVALID_ARGUMENT; while invoking C++ function hal.ex.submit_and_wait; while calling import; Evaluating export function 2; Evaluating functions\r\nERROR running file (/tmp/iree/modules/tf/math/mod/dynamic_dims_non_complex/iree_input.mlir): INVALID_ARGUMENT; while invoking C++ function hal.ex.submit_and_wait; while calling import; Evaluating export function 2; Evaluating functions\r\n```\r\n\r\n### KWS Streaming `lstm` (and others) in non-streaming mode\r\n\r\nIn this case [Vulkan passes but VMLA fails](https://gist.github.com/phoenix-meadowlark/a1cc70f8d5214a19e84bc727016ab59b).\r\n\r\n```\r\nE iree/hal/host/inproc_command_buffer.cc:244] DeviceQueue failure while executing command; permanently failing all future commands: iree/hal/vmla/op_module.cc:170: INVALID_ARGUMENT; Invalid binding set=0, binding=33\r\nE iree/tools/iree-run-mlir-main.cc:474] Failure for split at line #1: INVALID_ARGUMENT; while invoking C++ function hal.ex.submit_and_wait; while calling import; Evaluating export function 2; Evaluating functions\r\nERROR running file (/tmp/iree/modules/kws_streaming/lstm/non_streaming/iree_input.mlir): INVALID_ARGUMENT; while invoking C++ function hal.ex.submit_and_wait; while calling import; Evaluating export function 2; Evaluating functions\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat Vulkan is passing suggests that this a bug in VMLA and not higher in the stack, at least in the latter case.","closed_at":"2021-08-31T16:49:02Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"ht